<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48726" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trāma</span></b> , ae, f.
		cf.: trans, trāmes. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>the woof</i>, <i>weft</i>, or <i>filling</i> of a web
			(cf. subtemen), <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 113</span></i>
			Müll.; <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 90, 20</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Isid. 19, 22, 14
			al.</span></i>—Of a spider's web: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ipsa per se tenax ratio tramae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 24, 28, § 81</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">figurae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>a thin</i>, <i>lank figure</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					6, 73</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">putridae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>trifles</i>, <i>bagatelles</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 5, 2, 37</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
